                                "sense_id": "df801fab-7806-306b-af22-722fed4bf2d5",
                                "text": "He took an Uber rideshare to the other side of town."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9425e405-fd55-4f23-b93c-f01c065dfa50",
                                "sense_id": "df801fab-7806-306b-af22-722fed4bf2d5",
                                "text": "Like a sleepwalker, he got into the rideshare and sat in the back seat, his arms folded around the envelope."
